The '''Wither Artifact''' is an {{Epic}} [[Accessory]]. It is acquired through the [[Dark Auction]]. It reduces the damage taken from {{mt|Wither}} mobs by {{Green|20%}} and can be upgraded to a {{Item|Wither Relic}}. 

== Obtaining ==
The '''Wither Artifact''' can be purchased from the [[Dark Auction]] Rounds {{Green|1}}, {{Green|3}}, or {{Green|4}} with starting bid of {{c|10m}}. It has an overall {{Green|32.477%}} chance to appear.

'''Wither Artifact''' can also be obtained as a {{Gold|'''MEDIUM'''}} reward from [[Raffle of the Century]].

