== Tips ==
Since the '''Wither Artifact''' is acquired from the [[Dark Auction]], the price may fluctuate due to supply and demand. If no one at the auction has an interest in the item, the player may be able to bid significantly less than someone in a different lobby where multiple players desire the item. This appears to be a popular end game accessory because of the damage reduction against withers, which includes {{MobSprite|Necron}}.

== Trivia ==
* There was a bug where the Wither Artifact stacked with the {{Item|Wither Relic}} to get {{Green|45%}} reduced damage taken from Withers.
** This has been patched as of [[Changelog/2021/October 5|2021 October 5]].

